    "name": "Ticket Classifier API",
    "description": "Test suite for the Ticket Classifier Laravel API. Run against a real running instance (php artisan serve or Laragon) with a valid GROK_API_KEY configured — these hit the live Groq-backed endpoint, they are not mocked.",
